s=s.replace('''                    Row(horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)) {\n                        OutlinedTextField(hourText, { hourText = it }, label = { Text("Hour") }, modifier = Modifier.weight(1f), keyboardOptions = KeyboardOptions(keyboardType = KeyboardType.Number), singleLine = true)\n                        OutlinedTextField(minuteText, { minuteText = it }, label = { Text("Minute") }, modifier = Modifier.weight(1f), keyboardOptions = KeyboardOptions(keyboardType = KeyboardType.Number), singleLine = true)\n                    }\n                    Button(onClick = {\n                        val h = PersianDigits.toEnglish(hourText).toIntOrNull()?.coerceIn(0, 23) ?: 9\n                        val m = PersianDigits.toEnglish(minuteText).toIntOrNull()?.coerceIn(0, 59) ?: 0\n                        vm.updateReminderTime(h, m)\n                        vm.setReminderOffsets(oneDay, threeDays)\n                    }, modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()) { Text("Save reminder settings") }''','''                    Text("Alarm time and alarm sound are configured separately for every loan.", style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall, color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurfaceVariant)\n                    Button(onClick = { vm.setReminderOffsets(oneDay, threeDays) }, modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()) { Text("Save early-reminder settings") }''')
